#:
#:                    d0    d1    d2    d3    d4    d5    d6
#:     care  ON      5/4   6/5   8/5   8/6  10/7   9/7   5/8
#:     care  OFF     4/4   5/5   5/5   6/6   6/7   7/7   7/8
